# Normalise line endings in git; check out Windows scripts with CRLF everywhere
# (cmd.exe misreads labels and goto in batch files with LF line endings).
* text=auto
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.iss text eol=crlf

# Binary files
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
